    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Clement Herron Real Estate is pleased to welcome No. 1 Spire View, Mountrath, Co. Laois to the sales market.\r\n\r\nNo. 1 Spire View enjoys a fantastic position within easy walking distance of Mountrath town centre, with local shops, cafés, schools, services and everyday amenities all close at hand. The property also benefits from convenient access to public transport, providing excellent connections to surrounding towns and commuter routes. Mountrath is ideally positioned for commuters, with easy access to the M7 motorway, providing direct connections towards Dublin and Limerick.\r\n\r\nConstructed in 1998, this excellent three-bedroom, two-bathroom end-of-terrace property is situated in a convenient and established residential location. The property is presented in excellent condition throughout and is vacant and ready for immediate occupation, making it an ideal choice for first-time buyers, families or investors.\r\n\r\nThe accommodation consists of a welcoming entrance hall, spacious kitchen cum dining room, comfortable sitting room and convenient downstairs W.C.\r\n\r\nOn the first floor, there are three generously proportioned bedrooms, all benefiting from built-in wardrobes, together with a large family bathroom.\r\n\r\nThe property is heated by oil-fired central heating and also benefits from an open fireplace in the sitting room, creating a warm and inviting living space.\r\n\r\nExternally, the property benefits from its end-of-terrace position, with gated side access leading to a substantial private rear garden. The garden measures approximately 40m x 3.5m, providing an impressive amount of outdoor space and excellent potential for creating a private garden haven. There is also a fuel store.\r\n\r\nA section to the rear of the garden has not been used for a number of years and would benefit from levelling and reseeding. Once completed, this area has excellent potential to become a beautiful and private outdoor space, ideal for relaxing, entertaining or enjoying the garden during the summer months.\r\n\r\nEarly viewing is highly recommended to appreciate the excellent condition, generous accommodation and fantastic location this property has to offer."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Entrance Hall: 5.72m x 1.78m\r\nTimber flooring\r\n\r\nKitchen/Diner: 5.55m x 3.05m\r\nVinyl flooring, fitted kitchen, electric oven, dual aspect\r\n\r\nSitting Room: 4.95m x 4.43m\r\nTimber flooring, open fire, patio doors\r\n\r\nDownstairs W.C: .75x 1.02m\r\nVinyl flooring, w.c., w.h.b.\r\n\r\nLanding:3.00m x 4.95m\r\nCarpet, Velux window\r\n\r\nMaster Bedroom: 3.60m x 4.95m\r\nTimber flooring, built in wardobes\r\n\r\nBedroom Two: 1.62m x 4.27m\r\nTimber flooring, built in wardrobes \r\n\r\nBedroom Three: 3.03m x 2.43m\r\nTimber flooring, built in wardrobes \r\n\r\nBathroom: 2.92m x 1.80m\r\nVinyl flooring, bath with mixer tap, w.c., w.h.b\r\n\r\nFuel Store: 2.23m x 1.75m\r\n\r\nYard/Garden: 23m x 3.5m\r\n\r\nAdditional Garden: 21m x 3.5m"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "Fantastic Town-Centre Location – Ideally positioned within walking distance of Mountrath town centre, with shops, cafés, schools, services and local amenities all close by.\r\nSpacious Three-Bedroom Home – Three generously sized bedrooms, all featuring built-in wardrobes, providing excellent storage and comfortable accommodation.\r\nEnd-of-Terrace Property – Enjoys the benefits of an end-of-terrace position, including additional privacy and gated side access to the rear garden.\r\nLarge Private Rear Garden – An impressive garden measuring approximately 40m x 3.5m, offering excellent private outdoor space with significant potential.\r\nExcellent Condition & Vacant – Well-presented throughout and ready for immediate occupation, with no onward tenant in situ.\r\nExcellent Commuter Location – Convenient access to public transport and the M7 motorway, providing easy connectivity towards Dublin, Limerick and surrounding areas."
      },
